            "review_title": "Review at The Vegan Garden",
            "review_text": "Mario&Sandy\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam57 contributions\n0\nLost it’s touch completely\nMay 2020 • Couples\nThis use to be our go to vegetarian restaurant of choice. Now they have lost all of there prior luster from the mediocrity of its food to its non existent service with employees that don’t know their own menu. Sorry VG...we will NOT be coming back. We no longer recommend this establishment when there are plenty of rising vegetarian restaurants around HCMC.\nRead more\nWritten May 10, 2020",
