            "review_title": "Review at The Vegan Garden",
            "review_text": "Brown NYC\n10 contributions\n0\nGreat Vegan in Phu My Hung\nDec 2019 • Family\nNot many vegan restaurants in PMH, but Vegan Garden fills in the vacuum very nicely.\n\nGreat variety - to date I've tried Spaghetti \"Bolognese\", Spaghetti with \"Meatballs\", Vietnamese Banh Mi, Vietnamese Bun Cha Gio, stewed eggplant, eggless egg sandwich , pita sandwich, veggie burgers, fruit-based spring rolls, and fried cauliflower (love that sauce!)\n\nFood has been consistently delicious! \n\nGlad to have a vegan restaurant with so much variety in D7!\nRead more\nWritten December 20, 2019",
            "rating": 5.0,
            "review_date": "2026-10-14",
            "travel_date": "Recent",
            "feature_depth_status": "Schema-Full-Features-Validated"
        },
