            "review_text": "Chris B\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam8 contributions\n0\ndecent food-so so service\nJul 2019 • Solo\nUsually order the Bun Cha gio-but tried another one this time and wasn't that good. I will stick to what I know. Service is always lacking when I come by- I don't know always second guessing what you ordered, drink comes after you are finishing the meal-so timing is not good. Not too friendly as well-I will just try mang di-to go....i usually hit this place at least once a week but hoping more decent vegan options open to go to (anyone?)....\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten July 26, 2019",
