            "review_title": "Review at The Vegan Garden",
            "review_text": "cindynguyen29\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam28 contributions\n0\nExcellent vegan food\nJan 2019 • Solo\nI have been looking for a good vegan restaurant in District 7 for awhile and the Vegan Garden ticked all the boxes. They serve delicious vegan versions of dishes from both Vietnamese and Western cuisine which I find great. I usually order their food on take-away and I really like how they minimise waste as much as possible with paper bags, glass bottles for drinks and biodegradable packaging. I have tried their banh xeo, bun cha gio, goi cuon and banh cuon and so far they are very delicious and healthy. I love how the food is not too oily and always nicely seasoned. I usually find vegan dishes at other places dull but I genuinely enjoy the dishes at this place and even crave for more. I will continue to order here again and would recommend this restaurant to everyone.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten January 12, 2019",
