            "review_title": "Review at The Vegan Garden",
            "review_text": "Anouska P\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam30 contributions\n0\nBrilliant little vegan food truck!\nJan 2019 • Couples\nThe thing I love about this place is it offers a really big variety, from Vietnamese classics like the Banh Xeo which is AMAZING to spaghetti ‘ meatballs 😊 I must have worked me way through almost the entire menu now & every single thing has been great. We order in from here regularly but it’s definitely worth visiting the truck to meet the lovely owner. She’s a real character - super friendly, enthusiastic & passionate about plant based food. Was so excited when this opened & it has not disappointed 😊 I also love the wontons & the cauliflower wings - ohhh & she started doing ice cream too!!!\nRead more\nWritten January 8, 2019",
